Source
------
Upstream tag, unmodified:
Release:   https://github.com/VisualDataWeb/OWL2VOWL/releases/tag/0.3.5
Commit:    VisualDataWeb/OWL2VOWL @ 8b3bd03731432c1bc0b7eb7b9e26a0a676f5708f (tag 0.3.5)

The release has no jar asset, so the standalone jar is built from the tag.

Build
-----
Tools:     Maven 3.8.6, JDK 1.8.0_342 (per the jar manifest)
Command:   mvn -B -DskipTests package -P standalone-release
Output:    target/OWL2VOWL-0.3.5-shaded.jar (shaded, Main-Class de.uni_stuttgart.vis.vowl.owl2vowl.ConsoleMain)

Check
-----
The 101 OWL2VOWL classes (de/uni_stuttgart/**) are byte-identical to the
jar JitPack built from the same tag:
https://jitpack.io/com/github/VisualDataWeb/OWL2VOWL/0.3.5/OWL2VOWL-0.3.5.jar
The other classes are the shaded dependencies declared in the tag's pom.xml
(OWL API 5.1.1 and its transitive dependencies).

Usage
-----
java --add-opens java.base/java.lang=ALL-UNNAMED \
  --add-opens java.base/java.lang.reflect=ALL-UNNAMED \
  --add-opens java.base/java.util=ALL-UNNAMED \
  -jar bin/owl2vowl.jar -file <ontology.rdf> -output <ontology.json>
